    "show_share": true,
    "description": "EAQAN, a network of quality assurance practitioners in East Africa held its fifth Regional Forum in Limuru, Kenya on May 4-8, 2015. Over 120 participants from universities in Kenya, Tanzania, Uganda, Burundi and Rwanda attended the forum. This consisted of quality assurance practitioners, vice chancellors and deputy vice chancellors, executive members of national accreditation bodies and the Inter-University Council for East Africa (IUCEA).",
